<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθρ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθρη</span>
			, first in <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				13.22
			</span></i>, then in 
				Ion.
			 Prose, Com., <i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i>, and <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ αἰθρίης καὶ νηνεμίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.188
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ αἰθρίας ἀστράψω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.86
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.1.31
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθρίας οὔσης</span>
			<i>in clear weather</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				342a12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθρίης</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίας</span> abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				371
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς αἰθρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					939b15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. <i>the
				clear cold air </i> of night, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.68
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>
			<i>Aët.</i><i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span> in penult. exc.
			in dact. and anap., <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> l.c.]</div>
